  "description": "Asad Elixir by Lattafa is a bold, warm, and resinous fragrance that expands on the richness of the original Asad. It opens with smoky incense, saffron, and spicy citrus , creating a powerful and commanding introduction. The heart develops into amber, resins, and warm woods , giving deep intensity and a luxurious oriental character. The base settles into vanilla, leather, patchouli, and dark woods , delivering a smooth, smoky-sweet finish with excellent longevity. Asad Elixir is the darkest, warmest, and richest flanker in the Asad line — perfect for evening wear and cooler weather.",
